---
description: Campus Connect project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the instructions in AGENTS.md at the repository root. It is the single source of truth for Claude Code, Cursor and Windsurf.

- Source code lives in `src/`; routes in `src/app/`. Import with the `@/` alias.
- Styling uses NativeWind v4 (`className`). Do not mix with Tailwind v4.
- Never commit `.env.local`. Supabase values come from `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_*`.
